{"ok":true,"module":"io/output/d12","docs":{"io/output/d12/binding_port":{"type":"UInt16","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d12.binding_port.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d12.binding_port.help","enum_set":"flowio_binding_port_digital_output","label":"Port physique D12","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d12.binding_port.label","help":"Identifiant du port physique piloté par la sortie D12. Utiliser \"Non connecté\" pour laisser cette sortie logique non affectée.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d12.binding_port.help"},"io/output/d12/d12_active_high":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d12.d12_active_high.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d12.d12_active_high.help","label":"Actif à 1 D12","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d12.d12_active_high.label","help":"Si vrai, D12 est active à l'état haut; sinon active-bas.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d12.d12_active_high.help"},"io/output/d12/d12_initial_on":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d12.d12_initial_on.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d12.d12_initial_on.help","label":"État initial ON D12","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d12.d12_initial_on.label","help":"État appliqué au démarrage pour la sortie D12.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d12.d12_initial_on.help"},"io/output/d12/d12_momentary":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d12.d12_momentary.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d12.d12_momentary.help","label":"Mode impulsion D12","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d12.d12_momentary.label","help":"Active un fonctionnement impulsionnel pour D12.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d12.d12_momentary.help"},"io/output/d12/d12_name":{"type":"CharArray","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d12.d12_name.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d12.d12_name.help","label":"Nom sortie D12","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d12.d12_name.label","help":"Nom lisible de la sortie digitale D12.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d12.d12_name.help"},"io/output/d12/d12_pulse_ms":{"type":"Int32","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d12.d12_pulse_ms.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d12.d12_pulse_ms.help","unit":"ms","label":"Durée impulsion D12 (ms)","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d12.d12_pulse_ms.label","help":"Durée de l'impulsion automatique de D12.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d12.d12_pulse_ms.help"},"io/output/d12/retain_on_warm_reboot":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d12.retain_on_warm_reboot.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d12.retain_on_warm_reboot.help","enum_set":"io_output_boot_behavior","label":"Comportement au reboot D12","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d12.retain_on_warm_reboot.label","help":"Choisit si D12 applique son état initial au démarrage ou tente de conserver le latch matériel lors d'un reboot chaud. Sur MCP23017, la conservation est ignorée et l'état initial est appliqué.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d12.retain_on_warm_reboot.help"}},"meta":{}}